<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka T-bills ease, auction oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka T-bills ease, auction oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of three, six and 12-month treasury bills fell by 0.49, 0.55 and 0.44 percentage points respectively at Tuesday's auction, which was heavily oversubscribed, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		   Bids received   Bids accepted   Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     5,303	     2,513	  11.91 (12.40)</p>
<p>    6 months     3,029		 570	  13.06 (13.61)</p>
<p>    12 months    1,270		 450	  13.48 (13.92)</p>
<p>    Total	  9,602	     3,533</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
